many of them are there in total?\", \"I rang the second one earlier this afternoon about it, so could you log that call so I don't forget I did it?\", \"I might need to reach them again later, so can you pull up their contact details for me?\", \"Totally separate thing, I just realised it's her day and I nearly forgot, so could you send Vrilie a message saying happy birthday?\"], [\"Could you tell me who's invited to the paperweight delivery, please?\", \"Would you mind telling me how many of them there are?\", \"I phoned the second one. Could you please log that for me?\", \"Could you show me their contact details, please?\", \"On a different note, would you please send Vrilie a message wishing a happy birthday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w31-0049\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please email Vrilie the address of the party?\"], [\"Vrilie keeps asking me where it is and I don't want her getting lost on the way, so can you email Vrilie the address of the party?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w31-0051\", \"v\": [[\"Would you mind saving my bike lock combination in the locker, please? It's 72135.\", \"On another matter, I paid sixteen euros for tickets. Could you please put that in Valladolid trip?\"], [\"bike lock combination is 72135, stick it in the locker pls\", \"oh and i paid sixteen euros for tickets, put it in Valladolid trip thx\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w31-0052\", \"v\": [[\"I feel like I've been a bit rubbish at keeping up with people lately, so when was I last actually in touch with Deepika Zumham?\"], [\"last contact with Deepika Zumham?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w31-0053\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me, for rudder club, how much I've spent so far?\", \"Also, would you mind telling me which fish jobs are still open?\"], [\"rudder club — how much spent?\", \"open fish jobs?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w31-0054\", \"v\": [[\"Could you show me what I've spent on in rudder club, please?\", \"Would you please delete the first one?\", \"Oh dear, I didn't mean to do that. Could you undo it, please?\", \"On a separate note, could you record for Kanna Junzawick that I messaged them, please?\"], [\"rudder club expenses\", \"bin the first one\", \"oops, undo that\", \"Kanna Junzawick — messaged, log it\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w31-0055\", \"v\": [[\"umm what's… what's Amara's email address again?\", \"oh and, uh, can you show me my, like, newest photo?\"], [\"I'm about to send over some documents and I realise I don't have it saved anywhere handy, so what's Amara's email address?\", \"Totally unrelated, but I want to show my sister something I snapped recently, so could you pull up my most recent photo?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w31-0056\", \"v\": [[\"ok so what… what pictures have I got from this week?\", \"umm can you put the second one in the, uh, Summer 2025 album?\", \"and what other shots are in there now?\", \"hmm okay, delete the… the fifth one\", \"right so what, uh, what else is left in there?\"], [\"what pics have i got from this week\", \"put the second one in the Summer 2025 album pls\", \"wat other shots are in there\", \"delete the fifth one\", \"ok what's left in there now\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w31-0057\", \"v\": [[\"star the gardens membership paperwork\"], [\"I keep losing track of it whenever I need to renew, so could you mark the gardens membership paperwork with a star so it's easy to find?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w31-0058\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me which tasks I finished this week, please?\", \"Sorry, hang on a moment — would you mind showing me the photos from March?\", \"Going back to the tasks I finished, could you please tick off the sixth one?\"], [\"tasks done this week?\", \"wait — March shots?\", \"back to done tasks — tick off sixth\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w31-0059\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please add Vrilie to the Valladolid group?\", \"Separately, would you mind settling up my balance with Chetan Odhiambo for rudder club?\", \"Also, could you check whether there are any Crosora entries in my locker, please?\"], [\"add Vrilie to Valladolid group\", \"settle Chetan Odhiambo, rudder club\", \"Crosora in locker?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w31-0060\", \"v\": [[\"umm what've I… what's on my calendar saturday?\", \"oh hang on, quick one — which cairn tasks have I, uh, not done yet?\", \"ok right, back to saturday — can you move the viaduct one to, um, monday?\"], [\"saturday's calendar?\", \"wait — cairn tasks not done?\", \"back to saturday — viaduct to monday\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w32-0001\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me who I currently owe money to, please?\", \"I've phoned the Pryndan one. Would you log that call for me, please?\", \"Could you tell me which events they're coming to?\", \"Would you please create a task to reply to the Daan booking?\"], [\"who do i owe money to rn\", \"called the Pryndan one, log it pls\", \"wat events are they coming to\", \"add a task to reply to the Daan booking\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w32-0002\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you pull up the… the marimba club entry in my locker? not the password, just the, uh, the entry itself\"], [\"I'm trying to remember which email I signed up with, so could you find the marimba club entry in my locker? I just need the entry, not the password.\"]]}","ttft_ms":14622,"type":"result","duration_ms":32370,"uuid":"e56fafc8-9e2e-45ca-b897-191928219247","ttft_stream_ms":1284,"time_to_request_ms":145,"first_content_frame_ms":1284,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22446155,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278996509.6536,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
